{"name": "SELINI", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"174\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/ca5c4cf193a36365fbd10999ab5d0657.avif?t=1787219689\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/9b3574b621989c7ee0437b8055f61579.poster.avif?t=1787219689\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/9b3574b621989c7ee0437b8055f61579.webm?t=1787219689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/9b3574b621989c7ee0437b8055f61579.mp4?t=1787219689\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/>Dive into a nonlinear exploration adventure filled with corrupted replicants,  robot uprising, brutal warmachines and more. Guide a lone replicant from a war-torn metropolis through dunes, forest and sea as you unveil the secrets of this cryptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/7b10b618a3777e206c932e3d8af262f1.avif?t=1787219689\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore the secrets buried deep within a vast, ruined world. Only atmosphere, curiosity and discovery.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/4479c93bc3a68366b415fe6952d2aed8.avif?t=1787219689\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Moving platforms, hidden mechanisms and long-term objectives that reveal themselves through exploration.\u00a0Nothing is explained. The world reveals itself as you learn to read it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/df8236e922b67ce477f65bedb093ff77.avif?t=1787219689\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Defeat a boss, take the long path or be a little more observant while exploring. Any corner can hide a secret and every secret can unlock a new ability.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/c7c4a5ed320fd1427f7b8f812d7cea4b.avif?t=1787219689\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Corrupted replicants, corrupted machines, ruthless bosses and who knows what else...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>\u300b</i>No text or speech used for gameplay guidance\u00a0<i> \u300bNavigate the UI by interpreting international symbols</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/7cdb616fdd4cc344db21b002c89d7072.webp?t=1787219689\" width=\"1560\"/></span><strong>\"<i>A labor of love crafted by a solo developer over 10 years.\u00a0SELINI has been a journey of wild dreams, hard lessons and relentless self-growth.</i>\"</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/acb791564bfe63f12f81a53da0002aa9.avif?t=1787219689\" width=\"1560\"/></span> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "A deep wordless metroidvania with 20+ hours of exploration through fog-covered ruins and the remnants of a lost world. Gain new abilities, uncover hidden paths and discover meaning without dialogue or guidance.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/72f80e8c614239542021af199cea03249ba2b0ec/header.jpg?t=1787219689", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Metroidvania", "Platformer", "Adventure", "Difficult", "Indie"], "developers": "Cymban", "publishers": "Cymban", "release_date": "Feb 12, 2026", "price": "$19.99", "appid": "1434050", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/v8Nr29IsQko", "first_seen": 1770850800.0, "review_rank": 1208}